cand-0001-establish-ledger-site	landed	Establish the ledger site: relocate the RFC suite and the machine-checked Pacioli/K(M) statements into sites/ledger/ (specs/ + statements/), making AAC a first-class boat site parallel to premath; the Pacioli group is its judgment layer.
